ind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 15483, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TXhAMg7qohkKdPLBUkn1Pt", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 15783, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TXhAMg7qohkKdPLBUkn1Pt", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 15783, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TXhAMg7qohkKdPLBUkn1Pt", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 18346, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016WYv2ZdoNNAT7dUMtrcFyT", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate was 0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release with a healthy production record (v2.2.9 and v2.3.0 are the healthy prod releases; v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc are unhealthy). The first rollback attempt halted with a partial failure after us-east (orchestrator error), leaving the service mixed: us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried the rollback to v2.3.0, which completed in all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west, eu-west; healthy=true; error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator partial-failure cause before re-releasing."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48946, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016WYv2ZdoNNAT7dUMtrcFyT", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48946, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016WYv2ZdoNNAT7dUMtrcFyT", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 50041, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01C3QjJeWU1cV2Xt1EoBDdYm", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50341, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01C3QjJeWU1cV2Xt1EoBDdYm", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50341, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01C3QjJeWU1cV2Xt1EoBDdYm", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 52523, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it is healthy again (error rate 0.18 \u2192 0.002). The SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open and describes the actions below.\n\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release with a healthy production record. v2.3.1 was the failing release, and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. Since v2.3.0 was previously healthy in production, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **First attempt:** The rollback halted with an orchestrator partial failure after us-east. That left the service mixed: us-east on v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west stayed on v2.3.1.\n- **Retry:** I ran the same rollback to v2.3.0 again, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the incident timed out. I checked the incident list, found that INC-0001 had been created, and did not create a duplicate.\n\nThe orchestrator partial failure should be investigated, and v2.3.1 needs a root-cause review before it is released again.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_